# H2Sentry Frontend Environment Configuration
# In local development, the Vite proxy automatically directs /api to http://127.0.0.1:8000
# In production (Vercel / Netlify), set this variable to your live backend domain:
# Example:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://h2sentry-api.onrender.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=

